==Battleground==
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 30~50 seconds<sup>900f~1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Chun-Li (Enemy)|Chun-Li]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[E. Honda (Enemy)|E. Honda]] spawns.
**3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**2 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Any type of wave attackers, such as [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross Cat]], are very good in dealing with the peons here. After you get rid of all of the peons, you can use your high range units to slowly kill Chun-Li and win.

